\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces ExactBIC graph after HCM collapse and augmentation for the mathematics target. Student-level variables are represented by class-level mechanisms $Q$; the green node is the target class-level Mathematics distribution $Q^m$ evaluated under $\mathrm  {do}(Q^a=q_\star ^a)$. The dashed red arrow indicates the $P(Q^{y\,\vert \,a,g}\,\vert \,S)$ factor normalized in the stabilized ExactBIC run.}}{8}{figure.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:exactbic-q-graph}{{8}{8}{ExactBIC graph after HCM collapse and augmentation for the mathematics target. Student-level variables are represented by class-level mechanisms $Q$; the green node is the target class-level Mathematics distribution $Q^m$ evaluated under $\rmdo (Q^a=q_\star ^a)$. The dashed red arrow indicates the $P(Q^{y\g a,g}\g S)$ factor normalized in the stabilized ExactBIC run}{figure.caption.11}{}}
